# Vercel CLI's local-directory upload includes gitignored files that are
# still present on disk — .gitignore only controls git tracking, not what
# gets shipped to a `vercel deploy`. Mirror the paused-feature exclusions
# here too, or a clean Vercel build breaks on the missing `pdfjs-dist`
# dependency these files import (see .gitignore's own note on this).
src/lib/importDeck.ts
src/app/api/import-slide/
